6c:["$","p","p-32",{"children":"A Virtual Private Cloud is a logically isolated network in AWS where you define IP ranges, subnets, routes, and network security controls."}]
6d:["$","p","p-33",{"children":"A security group is a stateful virtual firewall associated with supported network interfaces and resources. Its rules control allowed inbound and outbound traffic."}]
